[{"title":"谢欧阳学士","author":"周权","text":"曾洒骊珠被短编，七襄欲报邈天孙。\n空怀春草池塘梦，莫写梅花水月魂。\n台阁文章端典雅，山林气质借清温。\n床头萍绿多矜色，长价还从薛卞门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14068,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"黄致和提点回自上京","author":"周权","text":"凌厉刚风笑傲间，兴豪不管紫笙寒。\n独飞明月丹霞佩，遥赴清都玉殿班。\n虚室春和融二景，苍精霜气薄三韩。\n归来羡尔清溪鹤，犹带閒云守洞关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14069,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"周权","text":"花事匆匆弹指顷，人家寒食雨晴天。\n香浮夜月梨飘雪，绿染春风柳拂烟。\n涉世百年真逆旅，忘机万事即安禅。\n独怜憔悴江湖客，犹记风流棹酒船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14070,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵令尹解官归九江","author":"周权","text":"满眼山河落木秋，远游时复赋《登楼》。\n解官彭泽如元亮，呼酒新丰似马周。\n岁月骎寻人易老，乾坤浩荡水空流。\n输君已了公家事，卧对庐山雪满头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14071,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金焦两山","author":"周权","text":"海暾红处谒仙山，不管刚风客棹寒。\n一鉴寒光开玉匣，两螺青黛落银盘。\n天低塔影搀云耸，地窄钟声度水宽。\n羡杀禅心如止水，任教四面自波澜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14072,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"呈马伯庸御史中丞","author":"周权","text":"振岳威声耸豸冠，袖中直笔佞难干。\n玉壶冰照一襟炯，白简霜飞六月寒。\n谔谔清风扬海内，棱棱劲节著云端。\n绝怜白首南州士，山斗弥高独仰韩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14073,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵陈伯和","author":"周权","text":"满襟风雪抱琴归，妙论如逢易九师。\n东阁观梅一樽酒，西窗剪烛十年诗。\n江湖汗漫心犹在，岁月峥嵘鬓已知。\n閒说少年都似梦，醉挥白笔写乌丝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14074,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵陈可道","author":"周权","text":"清谈洒洒许文休，袖有骊珠莫暗投。\n一味可人曲居士，半生取友石乡侯。\n无边风月归吟啸，有好溪山即钓游。\n目送孤云弦绿绮，落花风絮兴悠悠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14075,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽潘举翁","author":"周权","text":"曾坐春风醉叵罗，风流谈麈听悬河。\n棱棱气节生难敌，籍籍声名死不磨。\n洛社衣冠知有几，襄阳耆旧惜无多。\n可堪执绋溪前路，烟雨凄凄听薤歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14076,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"懒庵讲主得九江饼茶邓同知分饷其半汲泉试之因次韵","author":"周权","text":"解组归来万事轻，日长门巷澹无营。\n团香小饼分僧供，折足寒铛对客烹。\n色卷空云春雪涌，影沈江月夜潮生。\n一瓯洗却红尘梦，坐爱风前晚笛横。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14077,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜泊僧庐","author":"周权","text":"孤城灯火已萧然，独鹤犹归破远烟。\n钟鼓声沈沙外月，楼台影浸水中天。\n寒声有意侵僧榻，俗梦无由到客毡。\n笑我久乖松下约，夜凉归兴转凄然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14078,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵僧惠茶","author":"周权","text":"开樽酌溪渌，秋兴何萧骚。\n重哦惠休句，目送吴鸿高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14079,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼白石道士冯鹤屿","author":"周权","text":"白石长碧苔，閒庭落珠蕊。\n老鹤去不还，空山自流水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14080,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其一","author":"周权","text":"泉花湿阶云，篆烟寒瓦鼎。\n柴门閒树阴，坐玩清昼永。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14081,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其二","author":"周权","text":"闭门屏来辙，枕书睡初熟。\n觉来淡无悰，看遍阶南竹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14082,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其三","author":"周权","text":"流水数家村，青山白云坞。\n春晚落红深，夜寒溪上雨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14083,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其四","author":"周权","text":"凉蟾净如洗，酒醒夜初寂。\n山檐宿雨多，空阶响馀滴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14084,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其五","author":"周权","text":"枯藤堕晚花，竹外溪光满。\n山僧出几时，石上云犹暖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14085,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其六","author":"周权","text":"酸风侵短褐，野路迂涧南。\n薄暮欲飞雪，梅香点归骖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14086,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其七","author":"周权","text":"晨光烂乌几，博山穗烟碧。\n山童汲泉花，来作砚蟾滴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14087,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其八","author":"周权","text":"倦迹无造请，卜居翠微深。\n幽意素所惬，泉声隔空林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14088,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其九","author":"周权","text":"寒童引羸骖，路入苍巘去。\n深处有人家，鸡鸣白云树。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14089,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其十","author":"周权","text":"暮霰袭吟袍，夜火然枯竹。\n盎然坐春和，炉香芋初熟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14090,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其十一","author":"周权","text":"看松坐危石，瀹茗爨枯箨。\n振衣下山去，白云满幽壑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14091,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其十二","author":"周权","text":"西阳转林腰，水木愈清丽。\n归云不肯栖，浩荡弄山翠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14092,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂兴 其十三","author":"周权","text":"野芳韵幽襟，暄景逗春意。\n僧居白云深，清磬出林际。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14093,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"客至","author":"周权","text":"閒携雪瀑煮春茶，多病无钱送酒家。\n怪底今朝来好客，青灯开彻夜来花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14094,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题松","author":"周权","text":"桑树鸡鸣坎吠蛙，午烟隔水几人家。\n青松将谓专霜雪，春到山中亦有花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14095,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"扫径","author":"周权","text":"剥啄无人昼掩门，庭花春晚雪纷纷。\n山童不解山翁意，扫破苍苔一径云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14096,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"溪上","author":"周权","text":"薄云残雨晓天晴，暖翠浮岚入袂青。\n岸阁渔舟人不见，桃花深处水泠泠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14097,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚眺","author":"周权","text":"闪闪归鸦过别林，斜阳流水意沈沈。\n数声樵笛人何处，一路寒山晚翠深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14098,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"立春","author":"周权","text":"宴罢春盘转晓风，乾坤生意浩无穷。\n宿云新卷山前雨，元气淋漓万木中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14099,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪霁","author":"周权","text":"寒侵竹屋瓦灯青，独据枯梧兴似僧。\n落月推窗看残雪，梅花半树一溪冰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14100,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"渔翁 其一","author":"周权","text":"鹤发峥嵘两鬓丝，白鸥相近久忘机。\n绿蓑带雨不垂钓，閒扫秋云坐石矶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14101,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚望","author":"周权","text":"帖帖平畴稻未黄，疏烟老树带秋光。\n山钟敲断前村雨，一两归鸦背夕阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14102,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"写梅花赋","author":"周权","text":"竹屋青灯夜寂寥，十年江海鬓萧萧。\n兴来写尽梅花赋，月在寒梢雪未消。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14103,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"读骚","author":"周权","text":"灵均忠愤不能平，写尽芳兰杜若情。\n底事楚烟湘雨外，梅花不肯与骚盟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14104,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"首阳","author":"周权","text":"采撷芳甘岂疗饥，首阳千古怨斜晖。\n至今山下冰霜冷，不见春风长蕨薇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14105,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"元日","author":"周权","text":"东风收雪曙光开，春意浓浮柏叶杯。\n晴日满帘宾客散，寒暄先问隔年梅。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14106,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"携琴","author":"周权","text":"半生湖海鬓星星，归卧山林抱一经。\n起向梅花写岑寂，琴心三叠水泠泠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14107,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西轩","author":"周权","text":"幽梦初圆昼景长，黄鹂声歇燕飞忙。\n西轩过雨春云合，绿气浓薰笔砚香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14108,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"信题","author":"周权","text":"己识浮云似世情，岁寒老砚是心朋。\n平生不贷监河粟，自撷香芹煮涧冰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14109,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪后","author":"周权","text":"野梅香暖雪初晴，客子离居意似僧。\n欲策陈玄供醉帖，砚寒犹带夜来冰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14110,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"立秋日晚坐","author":"周权","text":"山云漠漠树苍苍，风荐池荷满意香。\n独据绳床眠未得